Package: python3-iax2
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Recommends: python3-cryptography
Description: pure-Python implementation of the IAX2 VoIP protocol
 py-iax2 implements IAX2 (Inter-Asterisk eXchange, RFC 5456) for Python
 asyncio and interoperates with Asterisk, including AllStarLink app_rpt
 nodes. It supports outgoing and incoming calls, MD5/RSA authentication,
 call tokens, Asterisk-compatible AES-128 encryption, registration,
 trunking, native transfers, a jitter buffer and built-in G.711 and
 signed-linear codecs.
 .
 This package also provides the iax2-tool command for testing IAX2 peers.
